/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (Introduction: With the rise of digital media, governments face the urgent task of managing an enormous volume of news content. This information often spans multiple ministerial jurisdictions and needs accurate classification to ensure relevant ministries are informed promptly.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
